        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Peanuts Movie, Peanuts\n- People: Charles M. Schulz\n- Companies: Blue Sky Studios, 20th Century Fox\n- Topics: American animation, comic strips\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Monroe Schulz was born on November 26, 1922, and died on February 12, 2000.\n- Charles M. Schulz, nicknamed Sparky, was an American cartoonist best known for creating the comic strip Peanuts.\n- Peanuts featured characters including Charlie Brown and Snoopy.\n- The Peanuts Movie is a 2015 American 3D computer-animated comedy film.\n- The Peanuts Movie was produced by Blue Sky Studios and distributed by 20th Century Fox.\n- The Peanuts Movie is based on Charles M. Schulz's comic strip Peanuts.\n- In some countries, The Peanuts Movie was released under the title Snoopy and Charlie Brown: The Peanuts Movie.",
